==Polish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈvwɔxɨ/|lang=pl}}
* {{audio|Pl-Włochy.ogg|audio|lang=pl}}

===Etymology===
Most likely from Latin {{m|la|Volsci}}, an Italic tribe, rather than from {{etyl|gem-pro|-}} {{m|gem-pro|*walhaz}} from {{m|la|Volcae}}, origin of terms for [[Wales]], [[Vlach]], [[Wallachia]], ''[[et cetera]]''.

